Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.96,0:00:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do this?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.59,0:00:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I created it from spirit force taken from you\Nand material sprites I stocked up.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is creation magic, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I control it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your spirit energy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know better.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you use it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.46,0:00:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be the bait.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave this space even if it was open,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.61,0:00:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,unless they take us out.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.33,0:00:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And you must retrieve the copy,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,or you lose cultivation.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.63,0:00:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.68,0:00:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll let them believe we can leave.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.98,0:00:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.51,0:00:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got Muluo immortal's soul stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.67,0:00:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.39,0:00:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same two as before.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.41,0:00:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.25,0:00:59.99,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Have you found it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.61,0:01:01.18,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.27,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's time you kept your promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.19,0:01:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If it turns out they can sense us, we call it off.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.89,0:01:06.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Isn't it strange you can't see the other three?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.21,0:01:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We revert behind the screen and come out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.59,0:01:07.40,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So your closed eyes are just a facade.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.53,0:01:11.25,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I assumed you relied on spirit sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a lock-up master.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.62,0:01:13.31,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Haven't you noticed they already left?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.38,0:01:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unlikely he senses us.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}None of you can leave this spirit space.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.74,0:01:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We draw his attention to the copy, and make him lose confidence.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.50,0:01:17.70,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't be so sure about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.83,0:01:19.39,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}None of you are space type.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.53,0:01:21.13,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How do you know we can't leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.13,0:01:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to doubt himself.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.93,0:01:23.69,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Qiuxian.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.50,0:01:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Among them, only the old frog can sense spirit bodies.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So if they don't see you,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,they will believe you aren't there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.09,0:01:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We move the moment I retrieved the copy.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As fast as we can, we hide on him.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.93,0:01:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be so light,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.52,0:01:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,he surely won't notice us.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.47,0:01:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless they discover us,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.85,0:01:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way for the two of them\Nto tell we're still there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.44,0:01:49.57,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Impossible...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.29,0:01:51.10,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stay here and watch.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I call Polao in.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.48,0:01:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He controls this space.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.26,0:01:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Only he can bring people in and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.51,0:01:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where he takes us,\Nthis can pose a risk.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.67,0:02:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they already found the Pearl,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,they must be somewhere in the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.14,0:02:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The top of a building would be the best for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.98,0:02:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be distracted while he's explaining the situation to the others.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.53,0:02:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't notice a rice-sized object falling.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We teleport before the space switch could be cut.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.19,0:02:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's when we escape.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.78,0:02:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So adorable!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So kawaii!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.03,0:02:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've stayed home...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.07,0:02:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.93,0:02:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's your friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.35,0:02:48.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,600)}Escape and Battle
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say this space is infallible?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.65,0:02:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have abilities unknown to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.23,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you be more careful?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The unknown is to be feared.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.02,0:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the strongest spirit space can't nullify every power.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.79,0:03:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine what ability could take them out of there.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have stayed to watch them.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of promise breakers...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, they aren't our objective.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we must act quickly.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, we're near the con.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.99,0:03:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What will be our next step?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.03,0:03:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I still remember you guys are after the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.21,0:03:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're frank.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.68,0:03:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We take our leave now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.97,0:03:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't steal it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.64,0:03:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.30,0:03:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fun working with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope next time we can have a good long talk.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.60,0:03:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Luo.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.66,0:03:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Soul Calling Stone we gave you...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.26,0:03:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.55,0:03:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, we used it...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.45,0:03:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to sense your approximate location.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder you found me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.48,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemies make the best friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can remove the tracking.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.79,0:03:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still can use it to contact you, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.94,0:03:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.22,0:03:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried in vain this time too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.28,0:03:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cultivation is never child's play.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.83,0:04:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we will.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.14,0:04:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You were awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were even more so.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.83,0:04:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.16,0:04:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.45,0:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a contest! I can win a limited edition game!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How come there's not a single place to hide...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.50,0:04:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If I just cross the road, they'll see me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I known, I'd have brought my cell phone...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.56,0:04:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know Xiaobai's number...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.59,0:04:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They walk in plain sight?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.14,0:04:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is safe?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.73,0:04:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have observed the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of masquerade.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.33,0:04:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep a low profile,\Nno one will pay attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.67,0:04:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have been mistaken.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.64,0:04:55.08,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So lifelike!\NWhat game is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.02,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can we make some photos?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.71,0:04:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.62,0:04:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I sense it wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.14,0:05:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"Double Deadly Alliance"?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.25,0:05:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a two-player game.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.11,0:05:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules allow any console game, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the one we're good at.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.96,0:05:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can choose a partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, can you play that?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.30,0:05:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can walk back and forth.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.57,0:05:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.86,0:05:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.97,0:05:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.33,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.55,0:05:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's only one prize.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.43,0:05:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need the prize.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.85,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be fair to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.55,0:05:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be with my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.97,0:05:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lose, so what?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, little girl!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it like that, sir...!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.63,0:05:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not that good.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.78,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never won.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem! Come!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.01,0:05:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not very glorious to win like this, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's still do our best.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.31,0:05:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your controllers disconnected?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.73,0:05:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This didn't work.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.85,0:06:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a lot of humans like me...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.82,0:06:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.62,0:06:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.70,0:06:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuanli?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.39,0:06:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for them to come out?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.16,0:06:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.20,0:06:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We must wrap this up soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.44,0:06:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Polao.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to head inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.48,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go inside, however,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.49,0:06:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no ability to sense the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.75,0:06:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't moved for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They are in the southeast corner.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.69,0:06:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A black cat.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be easy to find.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.49,0:06:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Southeast corner...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.54,0:06:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I can feel spirit aura there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will wait for an opportunity.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.77,0:06:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.05,0:06:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We leave it to you, old frog.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Old frog?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.53,0:06:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.00,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,759)}Unwritten Rule
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.11,0:07:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be him.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.59,0:07:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.40,0:07:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have heard me...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.51,0:07:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he answer?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.69,0:07:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Xiaobai?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.87,0:07:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with her.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.45,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Some spirits are looking for them.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.82,0:07:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're already here.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.49,0:07:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen, my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You left without a word.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.06,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to keep your promise?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.66,0:07:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd tell him to give it to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.70,0:07:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, give it to them.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.80,0:07:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're angry only because I could escape.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.25,0:07:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it was rather impolite?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.83,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Was locking me up a polite thing to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.09,0:08:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who possesses the prize of a vow quest, must bear the risk of robbery.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an unwritten rule of vow quests.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this an unwritten rule?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that Laojun won't intervene.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows he can't deal with events on Earth.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.76,0:08:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When some people started to say this, the others accepted it as a rule.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.89,0:08:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you're just looking for a reason to justify robbery.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.73,0:08:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you really think this is fair?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You would've beaten me.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you afraid now of getting hurt?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.24,0:08:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got Diting.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.99,0:08:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Diting can't get involved with the Pearl, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.17,0:08:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.88,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does, I'll give him a hard time!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.55,0:08:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Behave yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.65,0:08:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid old frog!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.26,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you're the boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.53,0:08:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This so-called Diting, maybe he's a fake!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.78,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.67,0:08:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.09,0:08:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse him.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.09,0:09:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sky Pearl!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.56,0:09:03.34,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Why do you need it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.59,0:09:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for you to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.53,0:09:06.32,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What if I don't give it up?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.51,0:09:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll take it by force.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.26,0:09:09.39,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,And what if the moment you attack,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.42,0:09:10.40,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I give it to Diting?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.51,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What good would it do you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.26,0:09:15.03,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,If I can't keep it,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.05,0:09:15.89,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'd feel better if you felt bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.69,0:09:21.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Think I won't do it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.84,0:09:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You two made up this scheme!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.26,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.83,0:09:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I certainly wouldn't mind retrieving the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.85,0:09:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you my word.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.29,0:09:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get the Pearl, I won't give it to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.69,0:09:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Qingqiu.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better tell them.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.39,0:09:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't accept prize robbery as a rule either.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.50,0:09:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we didn't wish to do it like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.50,0:10:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But we need the Pearl so much,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.77,0:10:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we would give anything for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.44,0:10:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible you're willing to part with it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.16,0:10:09.80,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.41,0:10:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To save our friend's life.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.97,0:10:15.51,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.79,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid! Why should we lie to you now?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.32,0:10:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sassy brat! Do you want me to eat you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.42,0:10:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't lying.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.74,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.98,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To avoid being deceived, Master Lao lent me the Mind-Discerning Mirror.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.61,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How convenient.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.98,0:10:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it to them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.40,0:10:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was that simple, we wouldn't have done all this!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do have any idea what it is?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.02,0:10:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.43,0:10:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really giving it to us?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.83,0:10:47.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You should have told us earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.75,0:10:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.25,0:10:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Sky Pearl! The hell thought you'd just give it away!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.14,0:10:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what it can do?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.72,0:10:55.56,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Do you not want it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on us...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.09,0:11:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We humbly accept the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are ever in need of our help,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.47,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,just inquire at the club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.57,0:11:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be at your service.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.46,0:11:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We are brothers now!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.15,0:11:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.32,0:11:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I still hate you!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.55,0:11:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We wish to bring home the news right away.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.21,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We must say goodbye now.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.86,0:11:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.25,0:11:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya later, little spirits!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.16,0:11:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're clients of the club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.71,0:11:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't Laozi have helped them?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.63,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was that simple,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the Pearl wouldn't have stayed at Master Lao for centuries.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.15,0:11:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how could Xiaohei take it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.58,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With his ability.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.40,0:11:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And because he's strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.53,0:11:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he stronger even than Gen?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.81,0:11:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I wounded him,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.61,0:11:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,he was stronger than Xuanli right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.34,0:11:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.46,0:11:47.68,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've said too much.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.74,0:11:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.78,0:11:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitten.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave up the Pearl too easily.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.10,0:12:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't regret it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.02,0:12:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.49,0:12:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Xiaohei who made him angry.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.50,0:12:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the Pearl has a special significance for him and Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to say...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.86,0:12:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You really gave it up easily.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.63,0:12:18.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,They needed it more.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.38,0:12:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sky Pearl can heal illnesses?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.32,0:12:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one type of illness.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.33,0:12:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not why spirits want it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.25,0:12:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why do they want it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.89,0:12:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes it so precious,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.25,0:12:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is that if an ordinary spirit gets it,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.59,0:12:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,they can become an immortal.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.75,0:13:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortal?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.40,0:13:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's basically a life elixir?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.84,0:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one way of putting it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.31,0:13:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If it makes anyone an immortal,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.04,0:13:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't there more people who want it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.39,0:13:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to get.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.85,0:13:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the hardest quest in the books of vows.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.50,0:13:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in Master Lao's realm,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.17,0:13:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,protected by powerful barriers.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.02,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, no one considers it a target.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.26,0:13:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.73,0:13:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.87,0:13:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In the case of Xiaohei,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.18,0:13:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,if he's within a certain range,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.86,0:13:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,barriers are as if they're not there.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.87,0:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.92,0:13:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect ability for stealing.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.57,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Don't be jealous...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.93,0:13:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And aren't there any very strong spirits who need it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.94,0:13:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There are.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.85,0:13:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But those spirits
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.13,0:13:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,don't want to offend Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.72,0:13:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,After all it's just a game he made up to amuse himself.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.83,0:13:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.65,0:14:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you just gave up on the chance to become an immortal?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.37,0:14:01.10,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I can't use it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.33,0:14:02.11,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,And it just brings trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.11,0:14:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did all the trouble find me...?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.98,0:14:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hoped for a bit of a fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.54,0:14:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen, where were you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.97,0:14:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Had something to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.04,0:14:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you win?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.20,0:14:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.99,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.56,0:14:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.81,0:14:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a special version of the console too.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.84,0:14:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Limited edition.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.03,0:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 1000 were made.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.28,0:14:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,1000 pieces?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.62,0:14:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a lot?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.62,0:14:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still so clueless.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.55,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There were 10 million preorders on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.96,0:14:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's the difference?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.85,0:14:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll know when the time comes.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is that I have it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.63,0:14:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you give me the box from yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.08,0:14:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you keep it??
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.02,0:15:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed that your box looks like mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.32,0:15:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the limited edition too!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.55,0:15:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.69,0:15:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a gift.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.12,0:15:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.98,0:15:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we both have it, we can play together.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.19,0:15:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You play All Living Creatures, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.97,0:15:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my player ID.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can friend me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.39,0:15:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alrighty.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.65,0:15:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing at the door?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're pretty dirty too.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.74,0:15:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.14,0:15:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.94,0:15:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.75,0:15:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.30,0:15:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, we're back!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.17,0:16:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.72,0:16:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you supposed to be back yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.82,0:16:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I brought the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.36,0:16:32.29,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,590)}{\fad(2400,0)}Early Morning\NCrescent Moon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.75,0:16:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening? Why this early in the morning?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.98,0:18:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.84,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:19:02.81,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:07.55,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:12.25,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:18.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.45,0:19:24.60,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:29.40,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:34.08,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:40.60,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:51.92,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:57.34,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:20:02.38,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:13.61,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.61,0:20:19.16,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:26.00,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:19:02.81,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:07.55,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:12.25,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:18.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.45,0:19:24.60,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:29.40,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:34.08,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:40.60,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:51.92,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:57.34,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:20:02.38,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:13.61,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.61,0:20:19.16,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:26.00,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
